{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And after that came out his brother</b> — כ״ן equals 70, corresponding to 70 nations, besides Jacob." "<b>And his hand</b> — three times in the Masorah: here; וידו הנטויה; וידו חלקתה להם. In Isaiah, at the downfall of the nations — that at the time of birth it hinted that the nations would fall by his hand."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:56.604084094Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}